{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b29kza94","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":233,"width":1140,"height":90},"name":"矩形 3","text":"先在RGB、热红外各自内部计算patch相似关系，\n再约束两种模态的关系描述保持一致。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/a10jqpsj","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":344,"width":1140,"height":44},"name":"矩形 4","text":"语义anchor的作用","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/x4r21kru","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":397,"width":1140,"height":90},"name":"矩形 5","text":"平均池化或可学习query可构建代表向量，\n用patch与anchor的相似度形成更紧凑的关系描述。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":508,"width":1140,"height":44},"name":"矩形 6","text":"辅助损失如何起作用","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#007F82","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r65knqtk","slideIndex":1,"position":{"left":60,"top":561,"width":1140,"height":90},"name":"矩形 7","text":"关系差异通过反向传播更新已有轻量微调参数，\n影响后续提取的特征；推理时不需要辅助损失分支。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Hiragino Sans GB","color":"#142C3E","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slideIndex":1,"text":"SS描述的是同一模态内部各个patch之间的相似关系。不同模态的外观可以不同，但目标及周围区域的空间关系可能有可比较的部分。我们将两个模态各自得到的关系描述进行比较。语义anchor是另一种更紧凑的关系表示：例如平均池化构建一个代表向量，再计算各patch与它的相似度。可学习query也是师兄提出的备选构建方式，但当前没有实现为主实验。最后，关系差异通过辅助损失反向传播，更新已有可训练参数，并影响之后的特征提取，不是在同一次前向中直接改写特征。\n依据：师兄建议；SEATrack-main/README_SS.md与semantic_alignment.py。关系建模文献见备份页。"}
